WEBVTT

00:00:27.413 --> 00:00:31.496
I was sharing some feedback on things
we could do better in the classroom.

00:00:31.829 --> 00:00:34.121
And honestly, in sharing that feedback,

00:00:34.121 --> 00:00:38.287
I was very nervous because often in
my research and in other research,

00:00:38.287 --> 00:00:42.496
it's very clear that feedback is
often met with defensiveness

00:00:42.996 --> 00:00:46.746
and what happened when I gave
the feedback defensiveness.

00:00:47.121 --> 00:00:49.704
So quite frankly, I was angry
and I was frustrated.

00:00:49.704 --> 00:00:54.579
I literally could feel my jaws clenching
up, my hands growing sweaty in my heart,

00:00:54.579 --> 00:00:58.496
starting to palpitate, because
I really wanted to say, hey,

00:00:58.496 --> 00:01:01.079
you're being defensive,
stop being defensive,